cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "promptdiff: A Pure-Python Library for Structured Comparison of LLM Prompt Strings"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-05-05
authors:
  - family-names: Deshmukh
    given-names: Vaibhav
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000
repository-code: https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/promptdiff
url: https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/promptdiff
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Pure-Python library for computing structured diffs and cosine similarity
  scores between LLM prompt strings. Provides a line-aware diff function
  returning (op, line) tuples, a unified diff formatter, and a
  character-bigram cosine similarity metric, all using only the Python
  standard library. Includes an optional tkinter-based graphical interface.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - prompt engineering
  - diff
  - similarity
  - natural language processing
  - python
